      {
        "id": 61102,
        "name": "Katsue",
        "username": "Katsue",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/katsue/{size}/2012_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-25T07:18:18.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Ronway\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/48/1856_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Ronway:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The Station Scrap is over the left right next to the Strike Force Scrap, or under it rather.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Well, I was under the impression that the Scrap was like Dominion's Trash, a place where cards go to die, rather than a discard pile. Certainly, the Strike Force Scrap appears to be like that.</p>",
