        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-25T12:58:04.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Sorry, not big on deck building so I tend to see scrap and discard as the same thing quite a bit. Yes after the Opposition uses a boost they send it to the scrap as they no longer have a use for it. They don't want to crowd up their deck with boost when they could be playing ships.</p>",
