        "created_at": "2013-04-25T13:37:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I’m not afraid to tell him what happens due to secrecy, as I think it’s something that should be in the rules (just like the question about how tokens are removes from techs). Rather, I’m afraid to tell him because I think the current rule for what happens is still volatile and may change, as the rule as “written” still causes a few issues in a few edge cases.</p>",
