        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-25T16:10:38.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm not afraid to tell for any reason!</p><p>When a station card is scrapped, it goes into the Station Scrap. When a sector runs out of station cards, cards from the station scrap are recycled back into the sector.</p>",
