        "created_at": "2013-04-25T18:51:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The edge case problem with this are if at least two sectors are depleted evenly, one sector runs out of cards, all scrapped cards are replenished on that sector, then the other sector depletes, but there are now few to no remaining cards to replenish. Unless the amount to replenish is limited somehow (such as to shuffle the scrap and replenish 30 cards).</p>",
